window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>On the brink of divorce, he'd play dirty for a second chance.</b></p> <p>Levi James is a complicated man. A teddy bear to his girls. A bossy lover in the bedroom. An elite bodyguard to the stars. When another man tries to get between him and his estranged wife, complicated doesn't even begin to cut it.</p> <p>Kelly James doesn't want complicated. Proving she can move on from her soon-to-be ex-husband seems like a brilliant idea. Until someone close to her goes missing, and the police tag Levi as suspect number one.</p> <p>When her mafia relations come into question, complicated becomes deadly.</p> <p><i>The Wife Assignment</i> is a standalone marriage-in-trouble romance with HEA. Intended for mature listeners.</p>"; 
